unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"授任與文獻用稱分存，未知起訖不補造。相國明示免職不終止文信侯，飲酖死亡不推定全部官爵終點；仲父為敬號非父親。篇末嫪毐文信侯歧義不作實授。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"th-shiji085-007","person_id":"cbr-p004793","title":"王后","kind":"royal_rank","mode":"grant","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei","source_id":"s-shiji-085-lubuwei","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:p006","quote":"秦昭王五十年，使王齮圍邯鄲，急，趙欲殺子楚。子楚與呂不韋謀，行金六百斤予守者吏，得脫，亡赴秦軍，遂以得歸。趙欲殺子楚妻子，子楚夫人趙豪家女也，得匿，以故母子竟得活。秦昭王五十六年，薨，太子安國君立為王，華陽夫人為王后，子楚為太子。趙亦奉子楚夫人及子政歸秦。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji085-007:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:p006","start":106,"end":108,"surface":"王后","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m006-0101","usage":"narrative"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"source_event","event_type":"grant","date_expression":"秦昭王五十六年","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei","source_id":"s-shiji-085-lubuwei","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:p006","quote":"秦昭王五十年，使王齮圍邯鄲，急，趙欲殺子楚。子楚與呂不韋謀，行金六百斤予守者吏，得脫，亡赴秦軍，遂以得歸。趙欲殺子楚妻子，子楚夫人趙豪家女也，得匿，以故母子竟得活。秦昭王五十六年，薨，太子安國君立為王，華陽夫人為王后，子楚為太子。趙亦奉子楚夫人及子政歸秦。"}]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"授任與文獻用稱分存，未知起訖不補造。相國明示免職不終止文信侯，飲酖死亡不推定全部官爵終點；仲父為敬號非父親。篇末嫪毐文信侯歧義不作實授。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"th-shiji085-009","person_id":"cbr-p004793","title":"華陽太后","kind":"royal_rank","mode":"grant","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei","source_id":"s-shiji-085-lubuwei","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:p007","quote":"秦王立一年，薨，謚為孝文王。太子子楚代立，是為莊襄王。莊襄王所母華陽后為華陽太后，真母夏姬尊以為夏太后。莊襄王元年，以呂不韋為丞相，封為文信侯，食河南洛陽十萬戶。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji085-009:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:p007","start":36,"end":40,"surface":"華陽太后","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m007-0036","usage":"narrative"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"source_event","event_type":"grant","date_expression":null,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei","source_id":"s-shiji-085-lubuwei","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:p007","quote":"秦王立一年，薨，謚為孝文王。太子子楚代立，是為莊襄王。莊襄王所母華陽后為華陽太后，真母夏姬尊以為夏太后。莊襄王元年，以呂不韋為丞相，封為文信侯，食河南洛陽十萬戶。"}]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"授任與文獻用稱分存，未知起訖不補造。相國明示免職不終止文信侯，飲酖死亡不推定全部官爵終點；仲父為敬號非父親。篇末嫪毐文信侯歧義不作實授。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji085-004","person_id":"cbr-p004793","surfaces":["華陽后","華陽太后","華陽夫人"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-085-lubuwei"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:p002","quote":"秦昭王四十年，太子死。其四十二年，以其次子安國君為太子。安國君有子二十餘人。安國君有所甚愛姬，立以為正夫人，號曰華陽夫人。華陽夫人無子。安國君中男名子楚，子楚母曰夏姬，毋愛。子楚為秦質子於趙。秦數攻趙，趙不甚禮子楚。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:p003","quote":"子楚，秦諸庶孽孫，質於諸侯，車乘進用不饒，居處困，不得意。呂不韋賈邯鄲，見而憐之，曰「此奇貨可居」。乃往見子楚，說曰：「吾能大子之門。」子楚笑曰：「且自大君之門，而乃大吾門！」呂不韋曰：「子不知也，吾門待子門而大。」子楚心知所謂，乃引與坐，深語。呂不韋曰：「秦王老矣，安國君得為太子。竊聞安國君愛幸華陽夫人，華陽夫人無子，能立適嗣者獨華陽夫人耳。今子兄弟二十餘人，子又居中，不甚見幸，久質諸侯。即大王薨，安國君立為王，則子毋幾得與長子及諸子旦暮在前者爭為太子矣。」子楚曰：「然。為之柰何？」呂不韋曰：「子貧，客於此，非有以奉獻於親及結賓客也。不韋雖貧，請以千金為子西游，事安國君及華陽夫人，立子為適嗣。」子楚乃頓首曰：「必如君策，請得分秦國與君共之。」"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:p004","quote":"呂不韋乃以五百金與子楚，為進用，結賓客；而復以五百金買奇物玩好，自奉而西游秦，求見華陽夫人姊，而皆以其物獻華陽夫人。因言子楚賢智，結諸侯賓客遍天下，常曰「楚也以夫人為天，日夜泣思太子及夫人」。夫人大喜。不韋因使其姊說夫人曰：「吾聞之，以色事人者，色衰而愛弛。今夫人事太子，甚愛而無子，不以此時蚤自結於諸子中賢孝者，舉立以為適而子之，夫在則重尊，夫百歲之後，所子者為王，終不失勢，此所謂一言而萬世之利也。不以繁華時樹本，即色衰愛弛後，雖欲開一語，尚可得乎？今子楚賢，而自知中男也，次不得為適，其母又不得幸，自附夫人，夫人誠以此時拔以為適，夫人則竟世有寵於秦矣。」華陽夫人以為然，承太子閒，從容言子楚質於趙者絕賢，來往者皆稱譽之。乃因涕泣曰：「妾幸得充後宮，不幸無子，願得子楚立以為適嗣，以讬妾身。」安國君許之，乃與夫人刻玉符，約以為適嗣。安國君及夫人因厚餽遺子楚，而請呂不韋傅之，子楚以此名譽益盛於諸侯。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:p006","quote":"秦昭王五十年，使王齮圍邯鄲，急，趙欲殺子楚。子楚與呂不韋謀，行金六百斤予守者吏，得脫，亡赴秦軍，遂以得歸。趙欲殺子楚妻子，子楚夫人趙豪家女也，得匿，以故母子竟得活。秦昭王五十六年，薨，太子安國君立為王，華陽夫人為王后，子楚為太子。趙亦奉子楚夫人及子政歸秦。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:p007","quote":"秦王立一年，薨，謚為孝文王。太子子楚代立，是為莊襄王。莊襄王所母華陽后為華陽太后，真母夏姬尊以為夏太后。莊襄王元年，以呂不韋為丞相，封為文信侯，食河南洛陽十萬戶。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:p011","quote":"始皇七年，莊襄王母夏太后薨。孝文王后曰華陽太后，與孝文王會葬壽陵。夏太后子莊襄王葬芷陽，故夏太后獨別葬杜東，曰「東望吾子，西望吾夫。後百年，旁當有萬家邑」。"}],"rationale":"依前5段子楚質趙與呂不韋游說敘事暫接；死亡太子與後立安國君分開，華陽姊與子政母各保留未名。王稱、太子及嵌套代詞待逐處核定。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:p002","text":"秦昭王四十年，太子死。其四十二年，以其次子安國君為太子。安國君有子二十餘人。安國君有所甚愛姬，立以為正夫人，號曰華陽夫人。華陽夫人無子。安國君中男名子楚，子楚母曰夏姬，毋愛。子楚為秦質子於趙。秦數攻趙，趙不甚禮子楚。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m002-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"秦昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004791","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m002-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004797","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m002-0021","start":21,"end":24,"surface":"安國君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004792","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m002-0028","start":28,"end":31,"surface":"安國君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004792","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m002-0031","start":31,"end":37,"surface":"有子二十餘人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體或未能區分成員，未補姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m002-0038","start":38,"end":41,"surface":"安國君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004792","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m002-0056","start":56,"end":60,"surface":"華陽夫人","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004793","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m002-0061","start":61,"end":65,"surface":"華陽夫人","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004793","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m002-0068","start":68,"end":71,"surface":"安國君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004792","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m002-0074","start":74,"end":76,"surface":"子楚","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004794","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m002-0077","start":77,"end":79,"surface":"子楚","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004794","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m002-0081","start":81,"end":83,"surface":"夏姬","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004795","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m002-0087","start":87,"end":89,"surface":"子楚","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004794","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m002-0105","start":105,"end":107,"surface":"子楚","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004794","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei","book_id":"b-shiji-085","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-085-lubuwei"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:p003","text":"子楚，秦諸庶孽孫，質於諸侯，車乘進用不饒，居處困，不得意。呂不韋賈邯鄲，見而憐之，曰「此奇貨可居」。乃往見子楚，說曰：「吾能大子之門。」子楚笑曰：「且自大君之門，而乃大吾門！」呂不韋曰：「子不知也，吾門待子門而大。」子楚心知所謂，乃引與坐，深語。呂不韋曰：「秦王老矣，安國君得為太子。竊聞安國君愛幸華陽夫人，華陽夫人無子，能立適嗣者獨華陽夫人耳。今子兄弟二十餘人，子又居中，不甚見幸，久質諸侯。即大王薨，安國君立為王，則子毋幾得與長子及諸子旦暮在前者爭為太子矣。」子楚曰：「然。為之柰何？」呂不韋曰：「子貧，客於此，非有以奉獻於親及結賓客也。不韋雖貧，請以千金為子西游，事安國君及華陽夫人，立子為適嗣。」子楚乃頓首曰：「必如君策，請得分秦國與君共之。」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m003-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"子楚","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004794","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m003-0029","start":29,"end":32,"surface":"呂不韋","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004790","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m003-0053","start":53,"end":55,"surface":"子楚","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004794","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m003-0068","start":68,"end":70,"surface":"子楚","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004794","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m003-0088","start":88,"end":91,"surface":"呂不韋","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004790","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m003-0108","start":108,"end":110,"surface":"子楚","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004794","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m003-0123","start":123,"end":126,"surface":"呂不韋","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004790","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m003-0134","start":134,"end":137,"surface":"安國君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004792","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m003-0144","start":144,"end":147,"surface":"安國君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004792","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m003-0149","start":149,"end":153,"surface":"華陽夫人","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004793","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m003-0154","start":154,"end":158,"surface":"華陽夫人","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004793","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m003-0167","start":167,"end":171,"surface":"華陽夫人","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004793","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m003-0175","start":175,"end":181,"surface":"兄弟二十餘人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體或未能區分成員，未補姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m003-0202","start":202,"end":205,"surface":"安國君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004792","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m003-0215","start":215,"end":220,"surface":"長子及諸子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體或未能區分成員，未補姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m003-0232","start":232,"end":234,"surface":"子楚","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004794","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m003-0245","start":245,"end":248,"surface":"呂不韋","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004790","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m003-0267","start":267,"end":269,"surface":"賓客","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體或未能區分成員，未補姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m003-0271","start":271,"end":273,"surface":"不韋","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004790","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m003-0286","start":286,"end":289,"surface":"安國君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004792","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m003-0290","start":290,"end":294,"surface":"華陽夫人","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004793","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m003-0302","start":302,"end":304,"surface":"子楚","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004794","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei","book_id":"b-shiji-085","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-085-lubuwei"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:p004","text":"呂不韋乃以五百金與子楚，為進用，結賓客；而復以五百金買奇物玩好，自奉而西游秦，求見華陽夫人姊，而皆以其物獻華陽夫人。因言子楚賢智，結諸侯賓客遍天下，常曰「楚也以夫人為天，日夜泣思太子及夫人」。夫人大喜。不韋因使其姊說夫人曰：「吾聞之，以色事人者，色衰而愛弛。今夫人事太子，甚愛而無子，不以此時蚤自結於諸子中賢孝者，舉立以為適而子之，夫在則重尊，夫百歲之後，所子者為王，終不失勢，此所謂一言而萬世之利也。不以繁華時樹本，即色衰愛弛後，雖欲開一語，尚可得乎？今子楚賢，而自知中男也，次不得為適，其母又不得幸，自附夫人，夫人誠以此時拔以為適，夫人則竟世有寵於秦矣。」華陽夫人以為然，承太子閒，從容言子楚質於趙者絕賢，來往者皆稱譽之。乃因涕泣曰：「妾幸得充後宮，不幸無子，願得子楚立以為適嗣，以讬妾身。」安國君許之，乃與夫人刻玉符，約以為適嗣。安國君及夫人因厚餽遺子楚，而請呂不韋傅之，子楚以此名譽益盛於諸侯。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m004-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"呂不韋","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004790","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m004-0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"子楚","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004794","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m004-0041","start":41,"end":45,"surface":"華陽夫人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"此處為華陽夫人姊的親屬修飾語，原MID保留，不作本人提及。"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m004-0045","start":45,"end":46,"surface":"姊","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004799","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m004-0053","start":53,"end":57,"surface":"華陽夫人","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004793","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m004-0060","start":60,"end":62,"surface":"子楚","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004794","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m004-0066","start":66,"end":70,"surface":"諸侯賓客","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體或未能區分成員，未補姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m004-0101","start":101,"end":103,"surface":"不韋","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004790","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m004-0106","start":106,"end":107,"surface":"姊","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004799","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m004-0150","start":150,"end":156,"surface":"諸子中賢孝者","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體或未能區分成員，未補姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m004-0228","start":228,"end":230,"surface":"子楚","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004794","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m004-0280","start":280,"end":284,"surface":"華陽夫人","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004793","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m004-0296","start":296,"end":298,"surface":"子楚","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004794","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m004-0334","start":334,"end":336,"surface":"子楚","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004794","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m004-0348","start":348,"end":351,"surface":"安國君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004792","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m004-0368","start":368,"end":371,"surface":"安國君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004792","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m004-0378","start":378,"end":380,"surface":"子楚","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004794","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m004-0383","start":383,"end":386,"surface":"呂不韋","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004790","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m004-0389","start":389,"end":391,"surface":"子楚","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004794","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei","book_id":"b-shiji-085","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-085-lubuwei"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:p006","text":"秦昭王五十年，使王齮圍邯鄲，急，趙欲殺子楚。子楚與呂不韋謀，行金六百斤予守者吏，得脫，亡赴秦軍，遂以得歸。趙欲殺子楚妻子，子楚夫人趙豪家女也，得匿，以故母子竟得活。秦昭王五十六年，薨，太子安國君立為王，華陽夫人為王后，子楚為太子。趙亦奉子楚夫人及子政歸秦。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m006-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"秦昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004791","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m006-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"王齮","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004800","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m006-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"子楚","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004794","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m006-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"子楚","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004794","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m006-0025","start":25,"end":28,"surface":"呂不韋","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004790","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m006-0036","start":36,"end":39,"surface":"守者吏","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004807","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m006-0056","start":56,"end":58,"surface":"子楚","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004794","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m006-0058","start":58,"end":60,"surface":"妻子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體或未分成員，保留原稱不補姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m006-0061","start":61,"end":63,"surface":"子楚","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004794","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m006-0063","start":63,"end":65,"surface":"夫人","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004798","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m006-0076","start":76,"end":78,"surface":"母子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體或未分成員，保留原稱不補姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m006-0082","start":82,"end":85,"surface":"秦昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004791","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m006-0094","start":94,"end":97,"surface":"安國君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004792","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m006-0101","start":101,"end":105,"surface":"華陽夫人","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004793","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m006-0109","start":109,"end":111,"surface":"子楚","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004794","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m006-0118","start":118,"end":120,"surface":"子楚","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004794","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m006-0120","start":120,"end":122,"surface":"夫人","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004798","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m006-0123","start":123,"end":125,"surface":"子政","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004796","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei","book_id":"b-shiji-085","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-085-lubuwei"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:p007","text":"秦王立一年，薨，謚為孝文王。太子子楚代立，是為莊襄王。莊襄王所母華陽后為華陽太后，真母夏姬尊以為夏太后。莊襄王元年，以呂不韋為丞相，封為文信侯，食河南洛陽十萬戶。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m007-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"秦王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004792","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m007-0010","start":10,"end":13,"surface":"孝文王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004792","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m007-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"子楚","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004794","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m007-0023","start":23,"end":26,"surface":"莊襄王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004794","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m007-0027","start":27,"end":30,"surface":"莊襄王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004794","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m007-0032","start":32,"end":35,"surface":"華陽后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004793","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m007-0036","start":36,"end":40,"surface":"華陽太后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004793","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m007-0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"夏姬","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004795","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m007-0048","start":48,"end":51,"surface":"夏太后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004795","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m007-0052","start":52,"end":55,"surface":"莊襄王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004794","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m007-0059","start":59,"end":62,"surface":"呂不韋","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004790","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei","book_id":"b-shiji-085","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-085-lubuwei"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:p011","text":"始皇七年，莊襄王母夏太后薨。孝文王后曰華陽太后，與孝文王會葬壽陵。夏太后子莊襄王葬芷陽，故夏太后獨別葬杜東，曰「東望吾子，西望吾夫。後百年，旁當有萬家邑」。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m011-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"始皇","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004796","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m011-0005","start":5,"end":8,"surface":"莊襄王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004794","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m011-0009","start":9,"end":12,"surface":"夏太后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004795","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m011-0014","start":14,"end":17,"surface":"孝文王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004792","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m011-0019","start":19,"end":23,"surface":"華陽太后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004793","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m011-0025","start":25,"end":28,"surface":"孝文王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004792","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m011-0033","start":33,"end":36,"surface":"夏太后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004795","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m011-0037","start":37,"end":40,"surface":"莊襄王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004794","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m011-0045","start":45,"end":48,"surface":"夏太后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004795","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m011-0058","start":58,"end":60,"surface":"吾子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、匿名者或未定局部指代保留，未補姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m011-0063","start":63,"end":65,"surface":"吾夫","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、匿名者或未定局部指代保留，未補姓名。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei","book_id":"b-shiji-085","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-085-lubuwei"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-085","source_id":"s-shiji-085-lubuwei","source":{"title":"史記／卷085","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷085","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷085&oldid=2027911","revision_id":2027911,"accessed_on":"2026-10-09","extent":"16段正文含太史公論，排除導覽、索隱述贊及現代版權。","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文；數位轉錄依維基文庫CC BY-SA 4.0，保留署名及固定版本。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","normalization":{"character_conversion":{},"editorial_readings":[],"extraction_note":"固定HTML與取得時版本一致，只去外緣空白；正文未見括號校讀提示。","n